X:1
T:Minuet in G Minor
C:Christian Petzold, long attributed to Johann Sebastian Bach
O:Notebook for Anna Magdalena Bach (1725), BWV Anh. 115
N:Transposed down a whole step from G minor to F minor so it fits the recorder (C4 to Ab5).
N:Melody and ornaments from the Mutopia Project edition of the Bach-Gesellschaft text
N:(anna-magdalena-05). Chords read from that edition's bass line. Cross-checked against
N:the flutetunes.com flute setting, which moves the bass's eighth-note runs in bars 4, 8,
N:12 and 28 up into the melody; this file keeps the original held notes there.
